        "subject": "LU-20860 utils: skip testing for agent and doc files",
        "message": "LU-20860 utils: skip testing for agent and doc files\n\nPatches that change only files that do not affect the build or tests,\nsuch as agent guidance (AGENTS.md, .agents/ skills), Markdown files,\nREADME, ChangeLog and .gitignore files, repository metadata, or\nrustreapi/ (not built or tested by Autotest), still run the full test\nmatrix.\n\nAdd these to the changed.py lists of paths that skip testing.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: Ia73c3a74301fbc37f21f06f48b2eb748313ebbe5\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/69826\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Charlie Olmstead <charlie@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
